Accountable (A): Compliance Analyst
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2929_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2929_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
