Responsible (R): Compliance
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per covered txn</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2929_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2929_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
