      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monitoring rule alert or analyst referral
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~50–200 alerts/month
Owner: Compliance Analyst
Participants: Compliance, LP, Trade Sales
Source: workflow W2930 — Suspicious Transaction Detection, Alert Triage &amp; Escalation</bpmn:documentation>
