        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: ERP generates suspicious-activity alerts based on rules (unusual size, velocity, structure, customer profile mismatch)
Responsible (R): ERP automation
Accountable (A): Compliance Analyst
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2930_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2930_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2930_Task7" name="Compliance triages alerts: reviews customer KYC, transaction pattern, business…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Compliance triages alerts: reviews customer KYC, transaction pattern, business rationale; dismisses false positives
Responsible (R): Compliance Analyst
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per alert</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2930_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2930_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2930_Task8" name="Compliance escalates true positives for STR filing and possible relationship…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Compliance escalates true positives for STR filing and possible relationship exit; documents decision rationale
Responsible (R): Compliance
Accountable (A): Compliance Officer
Duration: Per escalation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2930_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2930_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
